[{"page": 1, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q3-1", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "T3. Into Reticular Chemistry", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 150.9783477783203, 280.6503601074219, 172.68597412109375]}, {"text": "7%", "bbox": [290.6499938964844, 193.6215057373047, 304.6280822753906, 207.18873596191406]}, {"text": "3.1", "bbox": [172.68299865722656, 209.5625, 186.7479705810547, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "3.2", "bbox": [204.3090057373047, 209.5625, 218.37399291992188, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "3.3", "bbox": [235.93499755859375, 209.5625, 249.99998474121094, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "3.4", "bbox": [267.5610046386719, 209.5625, 281.6259765625, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "3.5", "bbox": [299.18701171875, 209.5625, 313.2519836425781, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "3.6", "bbox": [330.81298828125, 209.5625, 344.8779602050781, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "3.7", "bbox": [362.4389953613281, 209.5625, 376.50396728515625, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "∑", "bbox": [403.7760009765625, 194.6659698486328, 412.8818054199219, 229.256103515625]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [176.86700439453125, 225.50250244140625, 182.5634002685547, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [208.4929962158203, 225.50250244140625, 214.18939208984375, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "23", "bbox": [237.27099609375, 225.50250244140625, 248.66600036621094, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "12", "bbox": [268.8970031738281, 225.50250244140625, 280.2919921875, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "6", "bbox": [303.3710021972656, 225.50250244140625, 309.0673828125, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "12", "bbox": [332.14898681640625, 225.50250244140625, 343.5439758300781, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "5", "bbox": [366.62298583984375, 225.50250244140625, 372.3193664550781, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "63", "bbox": [402.6319885253906, 225.50250244140625, 414.0269775390625, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "Covalent organic frameworks (COFs) are a class of polymers that form two- or three-dimensional struc-", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 234.51513671875, 538.5785522460938, 300.4675598144531]}, {"text": "tures through reactions between organic precursors, resulting in covalent bonds to afford porous, crys-", "bbox": [56.69300842285156, 271.28851318359375, 538.5419311523438, 284.8557434082031]}, {"text": "talline materials. Two examples of honeycomb type 2D-COFs formed by boronate ester and boroxine", "bbox": [56.69300842285156, 258.4251403808594, 538.5701904296875, 324.3775634765625]}, {"text": "rings (repeat units indicated using dashed lines) are shown in the figure below.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 295.198486328125, 424.9312438964844, 308.7657165527344]}, {"text": "The black and red bold lines represent different building blocks in all COF topology figures.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 288.3131408691406, 461.5097961425781, 354.26556396484375]}, {"text": "3.1", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 618.0264892578125, 92.84233856201172, 631.5936889648438]}, {"text": "Determine the empirical formula of COF-1 and calculate the mass percentage", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 618.0264892578125, 480.5818176269531, 631.5936889648438]}, {"text": "(%, to two decimal places) of carbon in COF-1.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 629.9815063476562, 327.63262939453125, 643.5487060546875]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 641.9365234375, 169.74588012695312, 655.5037231445312]}, {"text": "The empirical formula of COF-1 is C9H4BO2, its elemental composition is", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 629.0741577148438, 454.1156921386719, 695.0265502929688]}, {"text": "C –", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 668.4205322265625, 128.5489501953125, 681.9877319335938]}, {"text": "12.01⋅9", "bbox": [169.73297119140625, 651.2781982421875, 196.95497131347656, 682.4095458984375]}, {"text": "12.01⋅9+4⋅1.008+10.81+32 ⋅100% = 69.77%;", "bbox": [132.33900451660156, 653.5050048828125, 310.18707275390625, 692.8771362304688]}, {"text": "C: 69.77%", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 692.33056640625, 159.9815216064453, 705.8977661132812]}, {"text": "Empirical formula: C9H4BO2", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 679.4671630859375, 247.6981964111328, 745.4195556640625]}, {"text": "1 pt for empirical formula.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 716.240478515625, 237.16192626953125, 729.8076782226562]}, {"text": "No penalty for [C9H4BO2]𝑛", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 713.2809448242188, 240.2602996826172, 749.4595336914062]}, {"text": "1 pt for C mass fraction.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 740.1514892578125, 226.21302795410156, 753.7186889648438]}, {"text": "no penalty if integer values are used for atomic masses", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 752.1065063476562, 372.66259765625, 765.6737060546875]}, {"text": "2.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 617.9505004882812, 521.8194580078125, 631.5177001953125]}]}, {"page": 2, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q3-2", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "3.2", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 167.35350036621094, 92.84233856201172, 180.9207305908203]}, {"text": "Calculate the internal diameter, d, in Å, of the honeycomb for COF-2, with the", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 167.35350036621094, 480.5763854980469, 180.9207305908203]}, {"text": "following assumptions:", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 179.30850219726562, 223.01499938964844, 192.875732421875]}, {"text": "• C–C/C=C (arenes) = 1.39 Å", "bbox": [130.87100219726562, 191.2635040283203, 259.1009826660156, 204.8307342529297]}, {"text": "• C–B = 1.56 Å", "bbox": [130.87100219726562, 208.20050048828125, 196.94432067871094, 221.76773071289062]}, {"text": "• B–O = 1.38 Å", "bbox": [130.87100219726562, 225.13650512695312, 198.4287567138672, 238.7037353515625]}, {"text": "• Note, the diameter of a circle, 𝑑, inscribed inside a hexagon, is given by", "bbox": [130.87100219726562, 227.15797424316406, 480.5757141113281, 261.74810791015625]}, {"text": "𝑑= √3𝑎, where 𝑎is the side length of the hexagon.", "bbox": [139.59799194335938, 240.89898681640625, 377.6703796386719, 275.96710205078125]}, {"text": "• Neglect the width of the linkers.", "bbox": [130.87100219726562, 273.228515625, 288.6092834472656, 286.7957458496094]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 285.1835021972656, 169.74588012695312, 298.750732421875]}, {"text": "For COF-2,", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 297.1394958496094, 163.8136444091797, 310.70672607421875]}, {"text": "𝑎= 2 ⋅𝐵−𝑂+ 2 ⋅𝐶−𝐶+ 2 ⋅𝐶−𝐵= 8.66", "bbox": [205.239013671875, 306.13397216796875, 390.0352478027344, 340.72412109375]}, {"text": "𝑑= √3𝑎= 15.0", "bbox": [263.9980163574219, 335.0259704589844, 331.2716979980469, 370.61212158203125]}, {"text": "𝑑= 2𝑟= 15.0", "bbox": [269.0889892578125, 365.90997314453125, 326.1846618652344, 400.5001220703125]}, {"text": "d = 15.0 Å", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 398.7585144042969, 160.23069763183594, 412.32574462890625]}, {"text": "3 pt for correct d", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 410.7135009765625, 193.09901428222656, 424.2807312011719]}, {"text": "2 pt if only a is given", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 422.6684875488281, 209.93511962890625, 436.2357177734375]}, {"text": "1 pt if only correct formula is given", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 434.62347412109375, 277.07305908203125, 448.1907043457031]}, {"text": "3.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 167.27749633789062, 521.8194580078125, 180.8447265625]}]}, {"page": 3, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q3-3", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "The structures shown below can form 2D and 3D COFs. For this question consider only formation of COFs", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 130.40113830566406, 538.5801391601562, 196.35354614257812]}, {"text": "with boronate esters, imines, and C=C bonds through condensation reactions. A–E represent compound", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 167.17449951171875, 538.5708618164062, 180.74172973632812]}, {"text": "classes with different functional groups.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 179.12950134277344, 243.57212829589844, 192.6967315673828]}, {"text": "Tetragonal means Tetragonal, Hexagonal means Hexagonal, Trigonal means Trigonal,", "bbox": [80.78900146484375, 660.7525024414062, 514.4866333007812, 674.3197021484375]}, {"text": "Kagome means Kagome, Tetrahedral means Tetrahedral.", "bbox": [80.78900146484375, 672.70751953125, 348.9776306152344, 686.2747192382812]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q3-4", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "3.3", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Fill all the table cells with either new examples of monomer combinations that", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 166.2294921875, 480.5756530761719, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "give the topologies shown above or with “XXX” if you are certain that no addi-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 178.18450927734375, 480.5756530761719, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "tional combinations satisfy that topology. Both the combinations and the “XXX”", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 190.1405029296875, 480.5844421386719, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "entries will be graded. Incorrect answers (both combinations and “XXX” entries)", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 202.0955047607422, 480.5827941894531, 215.66273498535156]}, {"text": "will be penalised. Blank table cells will not be graded.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 214.05050659179688, 363.2286682128906, 227.61773681640625]}, {"text": "Tetragonal", "bbox": [121.43299865722656, 264.4075012207031, 171.9315643310547, 277.9747314453125]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [143.83099365234375, 276.3634948730469, 149.5273895263672, 289.93072509765625]}, {"text": "Tetragonal", "bbox": [185.01100158691406, 264.4075012207031, 235.50955200195312, 277.9747314453125]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [207.41000366210938, 276.3634948730469, 213.1063995361328, 289.93072509765625]}, {"text": "Hexagonal", "bbox": [248.71800231933594, 264.4075012207031, 298.9575500488281, 277.9747314453125]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [270.9880065917969, 276.3634948730469, 276.68438720703125, 289.93072509765625]}, {"text": "Hexagonal", "bbox": [312.2969970703125, 264.4075012207031, 362.5365295410156, 277.9747314453125]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [334.5669860839844, 276.3634948730469, 340.26336669921875, 289.93072509765625]}, {"text": "Trigonal", "bbox": [379.4010009765625, 264.4075012207031, 417.8547668457031, 277.9747314453125]}, {"text": "Kagome", "bbox": [435.4630126953125, 264.4075012207031, 474.3068542480469, 277.9747314453125]}, {"text": "Tetra-", "bbox": [493.8760070800781, 258.43048095703125, 521.111572265625, 271.9977111816406]}, {"text": "hedral", "bbox": [491.1540222167969, 270.385498046875, 521.2392578125, 283.9527282714844]}, {"text": "A2 + B3", "bbox": [255.9199981689453, 292.3034973144531, 291.75323486328125, 305.8707275390625]}, {"text": "E1 + D2", "bbox": [319.80499267578125, 292.3034973144531, 355.0205383300781, 305.8707275390625]}, {"text": "C2 + D4", "bbox": [435.5989990234375, 292.3034973144531, 471.5816955566406, 305.8707275390625]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 351.63848876953125, 169.74588012695312, 365.2057189941406]}, {"text": "Tetragonal", "bbox": [121.43299865722656, 401.9955139160156, 171.9315643310547, 415.562744140625]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [143.83099365234375, 413.95050048828125, 149.5273895263672, 427.5177307128906]}, {"text": "Tetragonal", "bbox": [185.01100158691406, 401.9955139160156, 235.50955200195312, 415.562744140625]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [207.41000366210938, 413.95050048828125, 213.1063995361328, 427.5177307128906]}, {"text": "Hexagonal", "bbox": [248.71800231933594, 401.9955139160156, 298.9575500488281, 415.562744140625]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [270.9880065917969, 413.95050048828125, 276.68438720703125, 427.5177307128906]}, {"text": "Hexagonal", "bbox": [312.2969970703125, 401.9955139160156, 362.5365295410156, 415.562744140625]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [334.5669860839844, 413.95050048828125, 340.26336669921875, 427.5177307128906]}, {"text": "Trigonal", "bbox": [379.4010009765625, 401.9955139160156, 417.8547668457031, 415.562744140625]}, {"text": "Kagome", "bbox": [435.4630126953125, 401.9955139160156, 474.3068542480469, 415.562744140625]}, {"text": "Tetra-", "bbox": [493.8760070800781, 396.01849365234375, 521.111572265625, 409.5857238769531]}, {"text": "hedral", "bbox": [491.1540222167969, 407.9734802246094, 521.2392578125, 421.54071044921875]}, {"text": "A2+B3", "bbox": [258.50799560546875, 429.8915100097656, 289.170654296875, 443.458740234375]}, {"text": "E1+D2", "bbox": [322.39300537109375, 429.8915100097656, 352.4379577636719, 443.458740234375]}, {"text": "C2+D4", "bbox": [438.18701171875, 429.8915100097656, 468.9991149902344, 443.458740234375]}, {"text": "C3+D4", "bbox": [131.2740020751953, 445.8315124511719, 162.0861053466797, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "XXX", "bbox": [200.29100036621094, 445.8315124511719, 220.22607421875, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "A1+B2", "bbox": [258.50799560546875, 445.8315124511719, 289.170654296875, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "A1+B3", "bbox": [322.0870056152344, 445.8315124511719, 352.7496643066406, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "C1+D1", "bbox": [381.9280090332031, 445.8315124511719, 412.7400817871094, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "A3+B2", "bbox": [438.2650146484375, 445.8315124511719, 468.92767333984375, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "C1+D3", "bbox": [490.78900146484375, 445.8315124511719, 521.6011352539062, 459.39874267578125]}, {"text": "A2+B1", "bbox": [131.3509979248047, 461.7715148925781, 162.01368713378906, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "XXX", "bbox": [200.29100036621094, 461.7715148925781, 220.22607421875, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "C1+D2", "bbox": [258.4309997558594, 461.7715148925781, 289.24310302734375, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "XXX", "bbox": [327.447998046875, 461.7715148925781, 347.3830871582031, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "XXX", "bbox": [387.3659973144531, 461.7715148925781, 407.30108642578125, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "XXX", "bbox": [443.6260070800781, 461.7715148925781, 463.56109619140625, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "A4+B2", "bbox": [490.86700439453125, 461.7715148925781, 521.5296630859375, 475.3387451171875]}, {"text": "E1 + D4 in Hexagonal 1 is considered correct", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 489.5715026855469, 319.3402099609375, 503.13873291015625]}, {"text": "2 pt for correct combination in correct topology", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 501.5264892578125, 336.89453125, 515.0936889648438]}, {"text": "1 pt for XXX in correct topology", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 513.4815063476562, 259.96331787109375, 527.0487060546875]}, {"text": "-1 pt for incorrect placing of X or combination", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 525.4364624023438, 327.53363037109375, 539.003662109375]}, {"text": "0 pt for acetal from the correct combination only", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 537.3924560546875, 341.9754333496094, 550.9596557617188]}, {"text": "0 pt for blank box", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 549.3474731445312, 197.12962341308594, 562.9146728515625]}, {"text": "23.0 pt", "bbox": [495.1520080566406, 166.15451049804688, 526.921142578125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "Whilst imine-based COFs are easily synthesised, they are also vulnerable to hydrolysis under strongly", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 554.2201538085938, 538.5906982421875, 620.1725463867188]}, {"text": "acidic and basic conditions. The addition of hydroxy groups to the aldehyde or amine monomers can", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 590.9935302734375, 538.5557250976562, 604.5607299804688]}, {"text": "overcome this. IR spectrum of COF-3 contained stretches corresponding to the imine functional group,", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 602.9485473632812, 538.5673217773438, 616.5157470703125]}, {"text": "but COF-4 did not. COF-4 contains a different type of C=N bonds, and elemental analysis revealed a loss", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 614.903564453125, 538.5729370117188, 628.4707641601562]}, {"text": "of six additional hydrogen atoms per repeat unit relative to COF-3 as the only change. COF-5 irreversibly", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 626.8585815429688, 538.5909423828125, 640.42578125]}, {"text": "isomerises to COF-6, which did not contain imine stretches in its IR spectrum.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 638.8145751953125, 417.2680969238281, 652.3817749023438]}]}, {"page": 5, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "ocr", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [57.0, 67.5, 105.5, 82.0]}, {"text": "人 ChO", "bbox": [57.0, 84.0, 130.5, 110.5]}, {"text": "58th International", "bbox": [57.0, 114.0, 130.5, 120.5]}, {"text": "Chemistry Olympiad", "bbox": [56.5, 123.0, 130.5, 132.0]}, {"text": "Uzbekistan 2026", "bbox": [56.5, 132.0, 131.0, 139.5]}, {"text":