5]}, {"text": "mg g−1 of COF-9.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 454.8831481933594, 199.38461303710938, 520.8355712890625]}, {"text": "Indicate the number of UO2+", "bbox": [209.7019805908203, 454.8831481933594, 356.2142028808594, 520.8355712890625]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [345.5889892578125, 472.0482177734375, 350.07220458984375, 503.1795654296875]}, {"text": "ions absorbed per pore.", "bbox": [361.5889892578125, 479.7015075683594, 480.572998046875, 493.26873779296875]}, {"text": "Assume that all uranium exists as UO2+", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 470.9991455078125, 301.55120849609375, 536.9525756835938]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [290.926025390625, 488.16522216796875, 295.40924072265625, 519.2965698242188]}, {"text": "ions.", "bbox": [304.63800048828125, 495.8175048828125, 326.8353576660156, 509.3847351074219]}, {"text": "SOLUTION:", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 507.77349853515625, 169.74588012695312, 521.3406982421875]}, {"text": "𝑞𝑒= 𝐶0 −𝐶𝑒", "bbox": [268.6910095214844, 512.3739624023438, 324.89105224609375, 555.9615478515625]}, {"text": "𝑚⋅𝐿", "bbox": [297.6409912109375, 526.7579956054688, 319.0406799316406, 561.34814453125]}, {"text": "𝑞𝑒= 19.90 mg dm−3 −9.225 mg dm−3", "bbox": [138.79701232910156, 538.8561401367188, 305.26422119140625, 604.8085327148438]}, {"text": "5.000 ⋅10−3 g", "bbox": [204.40899658203125, 551.5721435546875, 262.7572937011719, 620.8965454101562]}, {"text": "⋅200.0 ⋅10−3 dm3 = 427.0 mg g−1", "bbox": [309.1719970703125, 541.7151489257812, 455.980224609375, 611.6535034179688]}, {"text": "Since one repeating unit (C36H27N9O3) represents one pore, the molar ratio of", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 571.5931396484375, 480.58099365234375, 637.5455322265625]}, {"text": "the COF-9 pore to UO2+", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 585.692138671875, 226.22918701171875, 651.64453125]}, {"text": "2 :", "bbox": [215.60299682617188, 602.857177734375, 229.3976287841797, 633.988525390625]}, {"text": "1.000𝑔", "bbox": [232.75698852539062, 618.5929565429688, 260.07440